@page
@model WoodruffDev.Pages.Services.ExpertWitnessModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Software Forensic Expert Witness";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">Service</span>
        <h1>Software Forensic Expert Witness</h1>
        <p>When code is on trial, I help make the technical case clear.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="service-detail fade-in">
            <h2>Service Overview</h2>
            <p>When software is at the center of a legal dispute, clarity matters. As a Software Forensic Expert Witness, I bring decades of architectural and development experience to uncover what happened, how it happened, and why it matters. Whether it&rsquo;s a code quality issue, a system failure, or an IP or licensing dispute, I provide in-depth technical analysis, expert reports, and courtroom-ready insights that attorneys and judges can trust.</p>

            <h2>My Work Process</h2>
            <p>Thorough, defensible, and communication-first.</p>
            <h3>Step 1 &ndash; Legal &amp; Technical Intake</h3>
            <p>We start with a consultation to understand the case, legal questions, and scope of the technical issues.</p>
            <h3>Step 2 &ndash; Discovery &amp; Analysis</h3>
            <p>I review source code, system architecture, documentation, and related evidence to identify key facts and technical patterns.</p>
            <h3>Step 3 &ndash; Expert Reporting &amp; Testimony</h3>
            <p>You&rsquo;ll receive clear, objective reports that explain complex issues without jargon. I&rsquo;m available for deposition and trial testimony as needed.</p>

            <h2>What I Evaluate</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Whether a failure was caused by poor design, bad code, or integration issues</li>
                <li>Software deliverables against contract or industry standards</li>
                <li>Ownership, licensing, or originality in source code</li>
                <li>Claims of IP misuse, negligence, or technical misrepresentation</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Going Beyond the Usual</h2>
            <p><strong>Developer-to-Attorney Translation</strong> &ndash; I break down technical details in language that attorneys, juries, and judges can understand&mdash;without losing the nuance.</p>
            <p><strong>Deep Technical Credibility</strong> &ndash; 25+ years in architecture and engineering, with books, talks, and real-world systems to back up every analysis.</p>
            <p><strong>Professionalism Under Pressure</strong> &ndash; I bring calm, focused clarity to litigation&mdash;even under cross-examination.</p>

            <div class="service-nav">
                <a href="/Services/FractionalArchitect">&larr; Fractional Architect</a>
                <a href="/Services/MicroConsulting">Micro-Consulting &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
